{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "mom6_templates",
  "description": "Expression-template library for the MOM6 equation of state (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the Wright 1997 full-range in-situ density law rho(T,S,p) and its analytic partial derivatives drho/dT, drho/dS, transcribed exactly from MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90 (MOM6 dev/ncar_260909 @301879336, fork stage1/EqESM-cesm-mom6 branch instrument/mom6-dumps) and shared by the mom6_eos.esm component. The law (Wright, JPO 1997, 'A new salinity equation of state'; a fit to UNESCO EOS-80 valid for -2 < theta < 40 degC, 0 < S < 40 PSU, 0 < p < 1e8 Pa) is rho = (p + p0)/(lambda + al0*(p + p0)) with the three polynomials al0 = a0 + (a1*T + a2*S), p0 = b0 + (b4*S + T*(b1 + (T*(b2 + b3*T) + b5*S))) and lambda = c0 + (c4*S + T*(c1 + (T*(c2 + c3*T) + c5*S))) (density_elem_Wright_full, MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:86-89; constants a0..c5 at F90:23-37, each with the Fortran's own units comment: a0 [m3 kg-1], a1 [m3 kg-1 degC-1], a2 [m3 kg-1 PSU-1], b0..b5 [Pa, Pa degC-1, Pa degC-2, Pa degC-3, Pa PSU-1, Pa degC-1 PSU-1], c0..c5 [m2 s-2, m2 s-2 degC-1, m2 s-2 degC-2, m2 s-2 degC-3, m2 s-2 PSU-1, m2 s-2 degC-1 PSU-1]). The derivatives (calculate_density_derivs_elem_Wright_full, F90:194-202) are the Fortran's hand-coded formulas I_denom2*(lambda*dp0/dT - (p+p0)*((p+p0)*a1 + dlambda/dT)) and I_denom2*(lambda*dp0/dS - (p+p0)*((p+p0)*a2 + dlambda/dS)) with I_denom2 = 1/(lambda + al0*(p+p0))^2; they are transcribed here rather than written as symbolic D(rho, T)/D(rho, S) because in esm 1.3.0 the D operator is a rewrite-target for discretization stencils (esm-spec §4.2 / §9.6.8) and is rejected by the CLI 0.7.0 evaluator for algebraic expressions ('unlowered_operator: rewrite-target operator D reached evaluation without being lowered to a stencil by a rewrite rule'). The polynomial templates (wright_alpha0/wright_p0/wright_lambda) are the shared sub-laws of both the density and its derivatives; the consuming component binds the 15 coefficients (declared there as named parameters with units, values from MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:23-37) and the state T [degC], S [ppt], p [Pa] at the call sites. All templates are match-less and invoked by name via apply_expression_template; the only dependencies among them are the model-level intermediate bindings (al0, p0, lambda are computed once by the component and passed to the density and derivative templates), so the body-reference DAG is acyclic (esm-spec 9.7.3).",
  "authors": [
   "EqESM stage 2 (wt/mom6-eos)"
  ]
 },
 "expression_templates": {
  "wright_alpha0": {
   "description": "The alpha_0 polynomial of the Wright full-range EOS (MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:86): al0 = a0 + (a1*T + a2*S), the specific volume at zero pressure offset [m3 kg-1]. The coefficients a0/a1/a2 are bound at the call site from the component's named parameters (F90:23-25).",
   "params": [
    "a0",
    "a1",
    "a2",
    "T",
    "S"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "+",
    "args": [
     "a0",
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "a1",
         "T"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "a2",
         "S"
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "wright_p0": {
   "description": "The p_0 polynomial of the Wright full-range EOS (MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:87): p0 = b0 + (b4*S + T*(b1 + (T*(b2 + b3*T) + b5*S))), the pressure offset [Pa]. Coefficients b0..b5 bound at the call site (F90:26-31).",
   "params": [
    "b0",
    "b1",
    "b2",
    "b3",
    "b4",
    "b5",
    "T",
    "S"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "+",
    "args": [
     "b0",
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "b4",
         "S"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "T",
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           "b1",
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               "T",
               {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                 "b2",
                 {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                   "b3",
                   "T"
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               }
              ]
             },
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               "b5",
               "S"
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "wright_lambda": {
   "description": "The lambda polynomial of the Wright full-range EOS (MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:88): lambda = c0 + (c4*S + T*(c1 + (T*(c2 + c3*T) + c5*S))), the sound speed squared at zero alpha offset [m2 s-2]. Coefficients c0..c5 bound at the call site (F90:32-37).",
   "params": [
    "c0",
    "c1",
    "c2",
    "c3",
    "c4",
    "c5",
    "T",
    "S"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "+",
    "args": [
     "c0",
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "c4",
         "S"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "T",
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           "c1",
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               "T",
               {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                 "c2",
                 {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                   "c3",
                   "T"
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               }
              ]
             },
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               "c5",
               "S"
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "wright_density": {
   "description": "The Wright 1997 full-range in-situ density law (density_elem_Wright_full, MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:89): rho = (p + p0)/(lambda + al0*(p + p0)) [kg m-3], with al0/p0/lambda the wright_alpha0/wright_p0/wright_lambda polynomials evaluated at the same (T, S) by the consuming component. Operation order as in the Fortran: numerator first, then the denominator sum lambda + al0*(p + p0).",
   "params": [
    "p",
    "p0",
    "al0",
    "lambda"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "/",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       "p",
       "p0"
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       "lambda",
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "al0",
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           "p",
           "p0"
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "wright_drho_dT": {
   "description": "The analytic partial derivative of the Wright full-range density with potential temperature, drho/dT [kg m-3 degC-1], transcribed from calculate_density_derivs_elem_Wright_full (MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:199-200): I_denom2*(lambda*(b1 + (T*(2.0*b2 + 3.0*b3*T) + b5*S)) - (p+p0)*((p+p0)*a1 + (c1 + (T*(2.0*c2 + 3.0*c3*T) + c5*S)))) with I_denom2 = 1/(lambda + al0*(p+p0))^2 (F90:198) passed in from the component. Same expression as the Fortran, same operation order; NOT a symbolic derivative (the esm D operator is a discretization rewrite-target, see the file description).",
   "params": [
    "T",
    "S",
    "p",
    "p0",
    "lambda",
    "I_denom2",
    "a1",
    "b1",
    "b2",
    "b3",
    "b5",
    "c1",
    "c2",
    "c3",
    "c5"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "*",
    "args": [
     "I_denom2",
     {
      "op": "-",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "lambda",
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           "b1",
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "+",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                 "T",
                 {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                   {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                     2.0,
                     "b2"
                    ]
                   },
                   {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                     3.0,
                     "b3",
                     "T"
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               },
               {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                 "b5",
                 "S"
                ]
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           "p",
           "p0"
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "+",
              "args": [
               "p",
               "p0"
              ]
             },
             "a1"
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             "c1",
             {
              "op": "+",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                 "T",
                 {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                   {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                     "c2",
                     2.0
                    ]
                   },
                   {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                     "c3",
                     3.0,
                     "T"
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               },
               {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                 "c5",
                 "S"
                ]
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "wright_drho_dS": {
   "description": "The analytic partial derivative of the Wright full-range density with salinity, drho/dS [kg m-3 PSU-1], transcribed from calculate_density_derivs_elem_Wright_full (MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:201-202): I_denom2*(lambda*(b4 + b5*T) - (p+p0)*((p+p0)*a2 + (c4 + c5*T))) with I_denom2 = 1/(lambda + al0*(p+p0))^2 (F90:198). Same expression as the Fortran, same operation order (see the file description for why not a symbolic derivative).",
   "params": [
    "T",
    "S",
    "p",
    "p0",
    "lambda",
    "I_denom2",
    "a2",
    "b4",
    "b5",
    "c4",
    "c5"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "*",
    "args": [
     "I_denom2",
     {
      "op": "-",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "lambda",
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           "b4",
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             "b5",
             "T"
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           "p",
           "p0"
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "+",
              "args": [
               "p",
               "p0"
              ]
             },
             "a2"
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             "c4",
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               "c5",
               "T"
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  }
 }
}
